# Per-MCP env for the sample server. The connector loads this file into
# this child's environment only — it does not leak into other MCPs.
# This server has no credentials of its own; .env is here as a template
# so Type 1 MCPs that *do* need creds (e.g. twilio-mcp-server) follow the
# same pattern. Copy to .env (gitignored) and add vars as needed.
